From e25fb13add8b212eb7c0f8d0b8acd53ff618cf49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:06:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1266/3799] soh: rename func_8006390C -> Debug_EditRegs

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the in-tree comment above it reads "Edit REG"; it reads the L/R plus C-button combos in inputCombos to pick a register group and adjust the selected register.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_debug.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/game.c     | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_debug.c  | 3 ++-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/include/functions.h b/soh/include/functions.h
index 00bb1fea5..5fbe7c022 100644
--- a/soh/include/functions.h
+++ b/soh/include/functions.h
@@ -854,7 +854,7 @@ void Regs_Init(void);  // was func_800636C0 [oot]
